      "content": "it's a good start, very clear on the facts. but i think it's a little too dry. it reads more like a news report than an appeal for help. \n\nit needs more heart. we want people to actually *feel* something when they read it, so they want to help. could you try a second version that's a bit more emotionally resonant? \n\nand just a reminder—the sentiment score for the last one was a bit low (around 0.3), so it needs to feel more \"positive\" or \"moving\" in terms of the emotional impact, but again, please don't go overboard or make it sound fake. just find that balance.",
